{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他连自己在等什么都说不清，只知道心里有股劲不肯停；心里没着落，身体先绷紧，想抓住什么却不知往哪找。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里没着落\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕一松劲就停下，便硬逼自己撑住；想到真要往前，又怕会丢下什么，心里也想歇一口气。\",\n      \"key\": \"丢下什么\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得该回应些什么，非得把理由想透才敢走；可一想到真要投进去，舍不得又冒出来，只好重找，连自己都难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"把理由想透\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想给不安找个来处，熟悉的感觉忽然清楚；可想起来了，眼下的难处仍在。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼下的难处\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-5\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的感觉还没散，身体已先想迈步；他隐约愿意向前，心里却还没认准方向。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体已先想迈步\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不知在等什么、心里有股劲不肯停的起点；补入心里没着落时身体先绷紧、想抓住什么却找不到方向的局部过程，解释B2、B3，不替不安指定情绪或对象。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留真要投入便怕失去什么、又想停下喘息的两难，也保留他强撑自己的动作。删去把不行动等同于认可现状的无依据判断，让B5中的维持尊严与想停下来都有具体的心理理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把寻找理由与舍不得反复回来写成同一个循环，保留他认为必须把理由想透才敢行动、反复失效后的难堪。删去抽象的“够有力”“确信变陌生”和作者替他提出的自我质问。同时保住S02的转折前提：此时他仍把想清楚当作行动条件，后面才会开始改变这一要求。也让B1中召唤般的感觉落到他觉得该回应些什么、却迟迟找不到足够理由的困境上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-4\", \"S01-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"补充\",\n      \"why\": \"补上v6缺失的B4：他试着寻找不安的来处时，熟悉的感觉短暂变清楚，却没让眼下的难处消失；随后身体先于念头想迈步，但他仍没认准方向。只写熟悉感及其对当下的影响，不把珠子里的旧场景写成真实往事，也不把身体的牵引提前写成已经坚定的行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "89261d3d-a992-4fb3-9858-f25071a5824a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T044741195416Z", "elapsed_seconds": 283.985, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T04:52:25.184585+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "77f2423fd9dae252fd35def3296eb42cefba74e241d2c19367a58fa3574e4168", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T044741195416Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "6717fa9c5486e45cee2a82f02daf656c81ba94cfd7f4f08586eccac945d0f551"}}}
